 Patch 1: patch1 ┃ Patch 2: patch2
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Patch mode: comparisons use only
the source lines quoted in the
patches.

═══════════════════════════════════
*    DELTA DIFFERENCES            *
═══════════════════════════════════
Signs mark edits made by only that
patch. A sign-less line with one
number is an edit both patches
make: a new number means both add
it, an old number means both remove
it.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
 old new│f       ┃ old new│f
        │@@ bravo┃        │@@ bravo
   2   2│bravo   ┃   4   4│bravo
   3   3│charlie ┃   5   5│charlie
   4   4│delta   ┃   6   6│delta
   5   5│echo    ┃-  7    │echo
        │        ┃+      7│P2_echo
   6   6│foxtrot ┃   8   8│foxtrot
   7   7│golf    ┃   9   9│golf
   8   8│hotel   ┃- 10    │hotel
        │        ┃+     10│P2_hotel
   9   9│india   ┃  11  11│india
  10  10│juliet  ┃  12  12│juliet
  11  11│kilo    ┃  13  13│kilo
- 12    │lima    ┃        │
+     12│P1_lima ┃        │

═══════════════════════════════════
*    CONTEXT DIFFERENCES          *
═══════════════════════════════════
Signs mark lines present in only
one result: - patch1, + patch2.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
