        │@@ bravo┃        │@@ bravo
       2│bravo   ┃       4│bravo
       3│charlie ┃       5│charlie
       4│delta   ┃       6│delta
-      5│echo    ┃+      7│P2_echo
       6│foxtrot ┃       8│foxtrot
       7│golf    ┃       9│golf
-      8│hotel   ┃+     10│P2_hotel
       9│india   ┃      11│india
